WEBVTT

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.310
<i>Through a dark hallway that 
should have been empty,</i>

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:22.720
<i>a child walks, making a disturbing 
dripping, dragging sound as she goes.</i>

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:27.940
<i>Her skin is utterly pale,</i>

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:36.500
<i>her cold, glass eyes glaring.</i>

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:42.930
<i>Or so I thought.</i>

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:51.080
<i>How did this happen?</i>

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:22.030
<b>Konohana Kitan</b>

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:27.040
<b>Episode 5
The Spring Rains 
Bring With It</b>

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:31.540
<b>Konohanatei</b>

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:31.530
Priest, what is this doll?

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:34.220
I'm told that it's cursed.

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.550
I've been asked to give it a cleansing.

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:43.290
Though all it does is speak, 
move, and grow its hair.

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:46.400
Hey, hey. Can you flip tables 
or throw plates or anything?

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:50.340
Only a barbarian doll would do 
that kind of classless poltergeist!

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:53.180
Aw, that's no fun.

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:55.310
That's rude, Natsume-chan.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:57.570
You don't have to be able 
to do poltergeist stuff.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:00.400
You're still great in your own way.

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:03.820
<i>Wait, is she trying to cheer me up?</i>

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:07.260
Your kindness can be cruel at times.

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:10.290
Did I say something wrong?

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:13.190
Do your arms and legs come off

00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:15.590
so you can go, like, "Gadoosh!" and transform?

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:15.750
As if!

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:18.640
<i>What's the matter with these people?</i>

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:22.460
<i>Normally, I can make people cry just by 
walking down the hallway at night.</i>

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:23.720
<i>This is humiliating!</i>

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.570
Your hair's gotten pretty long, Okiku-chan.

00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:28.520
Your name is Okiku-san?

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:30.180
Don't just make up a name for me!

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:32.980
Sakura, you have a pair of scissors, right?

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:34.390
You should cut it for her.

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:44.190
W-Wait! Children shouldn't play with knives!

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.110
Don't worry.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:49.450
<i>Her eyes...</i>

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:52.290
<i>They're scaring me.</i>

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:55.020
This is the first time I've 
seen Sakura-chan smile.

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:56.740
Don't struggle. You'll get hurt.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:04.710
<i>At least let someone else do it!</i>

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:15.510
Didn't your niece's doll look kind of like this?

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:17.710
It was actually pretty stylish.

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:18.990
Very avant-garde.

00:04:18.990 --> 00:04:20.920
Well, y-you know...

00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:22.170
It'll grow back.

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:26.210
Don't say that like I'm a kid who just cut
her bangs too short and can't go to school!

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:29.330
What's going on?

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:30.440
It's so noisy in there.

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:32.910
I'm a high-quality doll!

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:35.570
I was made by a master craftsman!

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:39.680
What's my purpose as a doll if I'm so ugly?

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:45.670
It's that defeatist way of 
thinking that makes you ugly!

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:50.680
Listen, if being born a girl automatically 
made you pretty, life would be easy!

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:53.520
Women become women through 
hard work and refinement!

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:55.820
Sakura-chan, give me the scissors.

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:03.990
<i>What incredible skill.</i>

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:08.400
<i>She's even doing her makeup.</i>

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:19.050
<i>This is me?</i>

00:05:19.490 --> 00:05:22.470
I'm not even the same kind of doll anymore!

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:23.970
Now she just needs a kimono.

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:24.910
Yep.

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:25.710
Listen to me!

00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:29.670
I liked this obiage, but let's use this.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:35.280
You don't have to do that for me.

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:38.210
Nacchan, can you bring me my sewing kit?

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:39.240
Okay.

00:05:41.430 --> 00:05:43.330
Use my old clothes, too.

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:45.510
Thank you.

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:47.810
I think I have some scraps.

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:50.700
Sakura, you too?

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:53.830
Me, too!

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:55.580
You don't have a kimono.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.490
Don't worry about it.

00:05:57.490 --> 00:05:59.790
Then may I help with the sewing?

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:01.290
Can you?

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:04.240
Yes, Bikuni-sama taught me how.

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:06.530
Can you do these frills, then?

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:08.040
F-Frills?

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:17.610
You're so clumsy, Yuzu-chan.

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:18.390
Let me.

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:21.180
Sorry. I've never done frills before.

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:23.330
Then you should have said so.

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:26.410
Hey, you can sew straight, though.

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:30.200
You have such pretty eyes.

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:36.520
Your glass is sparkly, and your 
porcelain skin is so white and clear.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:45.010
You must have been made with 
a lot of care for a really special girl.

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:49.130
Yuck! Japanese dolls are so creepy.

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:53.040
Mom gave it to us for her first grandchild.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:54.350
What can we do?

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:57.390
It's too intricate.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:59.130
Especially the eyes.

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:01.330
It's like it's staring at us.

00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:04.320
Put it away in the closet or something.

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:06.040
Sorry, little one.

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:23.920
Mom!

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:26.590
Please, Mom!

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:28.640
Buy me a dress-up doll.

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:30.470
One of the popular ones.

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:32.410
Buy me one, too.

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:34.650
Oh, all right.

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:36.290
Yay!

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:44.750
Hey, want to...

00:07:47.470 --> 00:07:49.110
play with me?

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:59.050
Hey, she fell asleep.

00:07:59.050 --> 00:08:00.980
Dolls sleep, too?

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:04.330
Don't wake her up, Urinosuke.

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:07.830
Someone...

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:12.090
Play with me.

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:34.980
Sorry we couldn't do very much for you.

00:08:34.980 --> 00:08:35.940
Not at all.

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:38.170
Thank you for your help.

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:39.780
Um...

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:41.910
What about the cleansing?

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:45.120
Oh, for that doll?

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:47.770
Why do I have to wear a waitress outfit?

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:49.950
You have so many complaints.

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:51.850
It looks really good on you.

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:56.730
No!

00:08:56.730 --> 00:08:59.840
It's had more than enough of a cleansing.

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:11.750
I see.

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:15.860
I can't turn down a request from the priest.

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:18.190
What's your name?

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:21.070
I, uh, don't really have a name.

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:22.860
Her name is Okiku.

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:24.610
Okiku.

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:25.300
Yes!

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:28.270
You'll have to work your way up from a maid.

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:33.370
Since when was it decided 
that I'd have to work?

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:36.840
We can't just let you stay for nothing.

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:41.050
I'm a top-class Japanese doll 
made by a master craftsman!

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:44.490
<i>You don't look like a Japanese doll.</i>

00:09:44.490 --> 00:09:47.260
And I'm a maid, of all things?

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:48.570
This is humiliating!

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:50.340
Want to go to the temple 
for your cleansing?

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:51.160
I do not.

00:09:51.160 --> 00:09:52.750
All right, then it's settled.

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:55.190
Hey! How does that work?

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:57.700
That makes no sense to me! Hey!

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:57.360
Why don't you start...

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:58.910
Oh, Yuzu.

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:00.800
Yes? How may I help?

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:02.860
Teach Okiku how to do her work, please.

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:04.980
Okay, got it.

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:08.040
<b>Konohanatei</b>

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:11.420
Yuzu-chan, can you bring me a washcloth?

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:13.510
It's coming down even harder.

00:10:13.510 --> 00:10:14.870
This sucks.

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:17.220
I can't wait for the 
rainy season to be over.

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:19.180
It's over in other places already.

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:21.170
Why is it still raining here?

00:10:21.170 --> 00:10:24.630
Yuzu went to the shed with Okiku.

00:10:25.050 --> 00:10:26.350
The shed?

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:29.650
Oh, for that guest.

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:36.580
Delivering meals is an important part 
of our job. Got it, Okiku-chan?

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:39.200
<i>That name has totally stuck now.</i>

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:41.790
But why are they in a shed?

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:43.910
It looked like we had more open rooms.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.030
Well...

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:52.320
Because this is a weaving shed.

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:06.170
Pardon me.

00:11:20.810 --> 00:11:22.640
I brought lunch.

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:23.780
Leave it there, please.

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:29.080
Hey, isn't that breakfast?

00:11:29.420 --> 00:11:31.680
Don't bother making 
the room too tidy, either.

00:11:32.030 --> 00:11:33.500
Don't get in my way.

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:35.890
Hang on! Do you really need to talk like th—

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:38.040
Pardon me.

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:57.900
What's with her attitude?

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:03.360
She must be so focused on her work 
that she doesn't notice anything else.

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:04.960
Is she really?

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:08.610
But she hasn't touched 
her food at all, either.

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:22.600
Actually, she hardly ate 
anything yesterday, either.

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:25.770
She's going to break down 
if she keeps it up.

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:27.160
What shall we do?

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:29.800
She's a special guest.

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:31.300
Special?

00:12:31.300 --> 00:12:34.170
I'll think about it.

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:35.460
Thank you.

00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:46.650
What is it, Yuzu?

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:47.980
Nothing.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:51.690
It's like accompaniment music.

00:12:51.690 --> 00:12:52.860
Accompaniment?

00:12:54.950 --> 00:12:56.480
That sound.

00:12:57.160 --> 00:12:59.760
<i>I wasn't the one chosen 
to become a priestess.</i>

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:02.870
<i>It's not that I've given up.</i>

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:06.420
<i>Once I'm free to resign, I'm going 
to aim to become a priestess again.</i>

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:10.470
You're right.

00:13:15.130 --> 00:13:16.680
This is for Iori?

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:20.230
This'll be easy to eat, even if she's busy.

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:21.440
By myself?

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:25.730
Oh, dear! You can't even do 
this easy job by yourself?

00:13:25.980 --> 00:13:28.990
You certainly have a long road ahead.

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:31.070
I can! It's not that hard.

00:13:31.070 --> 00:13:32.510
Don't treat me like I'm an idiot.

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:36.750
I don't mind serving it,

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:40.660
but I don't feel up to it.

00:13:58.100 --> 00:13:59.460
Okiku-chan?

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:02.060
Take this to the guest in the shed, please!

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:03.700
O-Okay.

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:09.290
I don't need a haircut anymore!

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:30.300
Pardon me.

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:40.510
I brought rice balls.

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:42.040
I never asked for any.

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:45.790
The head attendant hopes 
these will be easier to eat.

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:47.670
I'll eat them later.

00:14:47.670 --> 00:14:48.700
Leave them there.

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:45.240
That's so wonderful!

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:47.100
This isn't done yet.

00:15:47.100 --> 00:15:49.380
It'll be more beautiful when it's done.

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:54.720
No, I mean, the fabric is beautiful, but the 
way you use your hands is amazing, too.

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:56.170
It's entrancing.

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:19.490
<i>It was just like Satsuki-chan said.</i>

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:38.090
U-Um...

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:43.860
The loom sounded so much like music, 
I couldn't help but sing along.

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:46.090
I-I'm sorry.

00:16:46.090 --> 00:16:47.600
Pardon my intrusion.

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:47.600
It's fine.

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:52.810
I had grown tired of hearing the rain.

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:54.850
Can you stay and sing for a while?

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:56.950
Ahem.

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:19.150
It's coming together before my eyes!

00:18:19.150 --> 00:18:20.380
Amazing!

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:23.040
No, this isn't good enough.

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:27.240
My older sister works faster than me.

00:18:27.240 --> 00:18:29.470
She finished before I did.

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:32.910
My younger sister is better with her hands.

00:18:32.910 --> 00:18:34.430
She can make better-quality weaves.

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:43.030
I'm neither, so I want to become able to 
weave better and faster than they can.

00:18:46.670 --> 00:18:52.830
But being both good and fast is something 
neither of your sisters can do, isn't it?

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:59.530
I don't know your sisters, 
so I don't know how you compare,

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:05.240
but it's really exciting to watch the 
rain cloth come together by your hands.

00:19:06.230 --> 00:19:11.050
It must take a lot of time 
to weave threads of rain.

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:14.080
It's not something I could learn, is it?

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:20.100
This is something only we sisters can weave, 
because we serve the heavenly gods.

00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:22.180
It can't be anyone else.

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:25.890
So this is a gift for the gods of heaven?

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:29.570
Is that why you're in such 
a hurry to finish it?

00:19:30.010 --> 00:19:32.150
It's so beautiful.

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:35.520
I'd love for them to see it soon.

00:19:39.210 --> 00:19:40.480
You're right.

00:19:41.020 --> 00:19:44.440
I hope they appreciate it.

00:19:45.230 --> 00:19:48.070
But this isn't finished yet.

00:19:48.070 --> 00:19:49.920
It'll be done soon.

00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:52.880
I'll let you be the first one 
to see it. It's our secret.

00:19:52.880 --> 00:19:53.760
Okay.

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:33.080
Please don't overwork yourself.

00:20:33.470 --> 00:20:37.600
Be sure to eat when you get hungry, 
and rest when you're tired.

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:41.870
<i>Dried bonito.</i>

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:50.390
<i>Eat when you get hungry, 
rest when you're tired.</i>

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:54.540
<i>That way, you can keep up.</i>

00:21:02.730 --> 00:21:04.770
Okay. I'll work hard.

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:17.530
It's done?

00:21:17.870 --> 00:21:19.540
Congratulations!

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:21.830
Here. Hold this end.

00:21:23.330 --> 00:21:25.080
Don't let go.

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:27.260
Here we go.

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:31.750
Ready, and...

00:21:53.440 --> 00:21:54.320
Look.

00:21:54.810 --> 00:21:56.490
It finally cleared up.

00:21:56.950 --> 00:21:59.730
Summer is finally here.

00:23:35.060 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>Next Episode: 
Konohanatei Horror Stories</b>
